---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms and Conditions — STM Balance"
  description="Terms and Conditions for using the STM Balance website."
  language="en"
  pagePath="terms"
  includeApplicationSchema={false}
>
  <main class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-container">
      <p class="section-label">STM Balance</p>

      <h1>Terms and Conditions</h1>

      <p>
        Last updated: September 14, 2026
      </p>

      <section>
        <h2>1. Website Owner</h2>

        <p>
          STM Balance is a product developed by Platforma SAS,
          a company incorporated in the Oriental Republic of Uruguay.
        </p>

        <p>
          This website is operated by Platforma SAS and is primarily intended
          to provide information about STM Balance, its development,
          functionality and potential applications within the urban mobility
          ecosystem.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. Acceptance of the Terms</h2>

        <p>
          Access to and use of this website implies acceptance of these
          Terms and Conditions to the extent applicable.
        </p>

        <p>
          If a person does not agree with these conditions, they may refrain
          from using the website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. Status of STM Balance</h2>

        <p>
          STM Balance is a technology project under development.
        </p>

        <p>
          Some features presented on this website may already be implemented,
          under development, under evaluation or planned for future versions
          of the product.
        </p>

        <p>
          The presentation of a future feature does not by itself constitute
          a guarantee of availability, release date or integration with
          third parties.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>4. Institutional Independence</h2>

        <p>
          STM Balance is a product of Platforma SAS.
        </p>

        <p>
          Unless expressly stated otherwise, references to STM, public
          institutions, transport operators, companies or other organizations
          do not imply sponsorship, approval, association, authorization or
          official integration with STM Balance.
        </p>

        <p>
          Any institutional or technological integration will be communicated
          as such only when it exists and can be confirmed.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>5. Use of the Website</h2>

        <p>
          Users agree to use this website lawfully and not to engage in
          actions intended to affect its operation, security, availability
          or integrity.
        </p>

        <p>
          The website may not be used for fraudulent or unlawful activities
          or in ways that infringe the rights of Platforma SAS or third
          parties.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>6. Published Information</h2>

        <p>
          Platforma SAS seeks to keep the information on the website accurate
          and up to date. However, because the project is continuously
          evolving, some content may change, become outdated or be modified
          without prior notice.
        </p>

        <p>
          Information published on the website is primarily informational
          and does not replace official information published by public
          institutions, transport operators or other third parties.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>7. Future Services</h2>

        <p>
          In the future, STM Balance may incorporate user accounts,
          integrations, STM card-related services, mobility features,
          payments or other digital tools.
        </p>

        <p>
          Where a feature requires specific conditions, additional consent,
          contracting, payment or the processing of personal data, additional
          terms may apply and will be communicated when appropriate.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>8. Intellectual Property</h2>

        <p>
          The software, design, content, structure, visual identity,
          documentation and other materials belonging to STM Balance and
          Platforma SAS are protected by applicable intellectual property
          laws, except for elements owned by third parties.
        </p>

        <p>
          Access to the website does not grant users ownership rights over
          such materials or authorization to reproduce, modify, distribute
          or exploit them beyond what is permitted by applicable law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>9. Third-Party Trademarks and Elements</h2>

        <p>
          Names, trademarks, logos, services and other identifying elements
          belonging to third parties remain the property of their respective
          owners.
        </p>

        <p>
          Any reference to such elements within STM Balance is descriptive,
          informational or related to potential integrations and does not
          imply any transfer of rights over them.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>10. Third-Party Links and Services</h2>

        <p>
          The website may include links to websites, platforms or services
          operated by third parties.
        </p>

        <p>
          Platforma SAS does not control the content, availability, policies
          or conditions of those services and is not responsible for actions
          attributable to such third parties, without prejudice to any
          responsibilities that may apply under applicable law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>11. Website Availability</h2>

        <p>
          Platforma SAS may carry out maintenance, updates or modifications
          to the website and does not guarantee uninterrupted availability.
        </p>

        <p>
          Interruptions may occur due to technical reasons, maintenance,
          third-party services or other circumstances beyond the reasonable
          control of Platforma SAS.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>12. Liability</h2>

        <p>
          To the extent permitted by applicable law, Platforma SAS will not
          be liable for damages arising exclusively from improper use of the
          website, information provided by third parties or interruptions
          beyond its reasonable control.
        </p>

        <p>
          Nothing in these Terms and Conditions is intended to exclude or
          limit rights or liabilities that cannot be excluded under
          Uruguayan law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>13. Privacy and Personal Data</h2>

        <p>
          The processing of personal data related to STM Balance is governed
          by the applicable Privacy Policy and the laws in force in the
          Oriental Republic of Uruguay.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>14. Changes to the Terms</h2>

        <p>
          Platforma SAS may modify these Terms and Conditions to reflect the
          evolution of STM Balance, new features, technological changes or
          legal requirements.
        </p>

        <p>
          The current version will be available on this page and will indicate
          the date of its latest update.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>15. Applicable Law</h2>

        <p>
          These Terms and Conditions are governed by the laws of the Oriental
          Republic of Uruguay, without prejudice to any non-waivable rights
          that consumers and users may have under applicable law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>16. Contact</h2>

        <p>
          Questions related to these Terms and Conditions may be addressed to
          Platforma SAS through the official STM Balance contact channels.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
